  "definition": "Demonstration of Avoidance and Minimization",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-10-23",
  "historyNote": "#12803, eff 12-15-19; amd by #12954, eff 12-24-19 (formerly Env-Wt 309.07); amd by #12976, eff 1-22-20; ss by #13124, eff 10-23-20",
